1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
If you have ADHD and can't finish books, stop scrolling.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,800
I used to reread the exact same paragraph ten times in a row before giving up completely.

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:19,500
Then I imported my entire textbook into VoiceReader, turned on the hyper-realistic narrator at two-times speed, and finished three full chapters while doing my laundry without losing focus once.

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Is this a genius productivity hack, or does listening count as actual cheating?
